type: dataset
title: "CPS space and co-location"
abstract: "Chicago Public Schools (CPS) space utilization for school year 2025–26
  (SY2026), with the district's school locations and co-located campuses, the
  school-based health center roster, Chicago Public Library branches, Chicago Park
  District buildings, and the City of Chicago's clinic, senior center and workforce
  center locations. Companion files record, wherever a City building footprint was
  matched to a school, library branch, park building or City service site, that
  footprint, a point inside it and how confidently it was matched. The release also
  carries a community-area summary, the seven Chicago Department of Public Health
  mental health centers the article measures distances to, and facts.json, every
  figure the project page states. It is the dataset behind an exploratory map and the
  article 'Chicago's underutilized schools are an unrealized opportunity', part one of
  a three-part series."
